`,r.jsx(o.p,{children:"I started noticing how scattered the database interaction code was. To prepare for BadgeService, I refactored my code and built DatabaseService first. This class contains all the database functionality, which involved creating tables, updating, deleting, and fetching info. By defining all the functions as static methods, they're callable from anywhere in the app. And now, with all the database interactions combined in one file, the code feels cleaner and more modular."}),`
